<title>CANADA: Canada July natural gas sales rise 1.0 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada July natural gas sales rise 1.0 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian sales of natural gas rose 1.0 percent in July from the same month a year earlier, to 3,417,594 thousand cubic metres, Statistics Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>Thousands of cubic meters and percentage changes:</p>
<p>				     July 96     July 95	Pct</p>
<p>Total			     3,417,594    3,382,915   +1.0</p>
<p>Residential sales		 414,693	393,269   +5.4</p>
<p>Commercial sales		  319,106	308,766   +3.3</p>
<p>Industrial			1,776,351    1,817,597    n/a</p>
<p>Direct sales			907,444	863,283</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact Gary Smalldridge, Energy Section, at 613-951-3567)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613 235-6745</p>
</text>
